q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;3f16e135-4eb3-4da2-bfdd-8d6e21b77024&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;02. End hunger, achieve food security and improved nutrition and promote sustainable agriculture&q;,&q;place&q;:1,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;67a4dbfa-ce65-4169-8868-8629182546af&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;03. Ensure healthy lives and promote well-being for all at all ages&q;,&q;place&q;:2,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;4e4bd84d-f59b-46c6-b326-e91067edddbf&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;04. Ensure inclusive and equitable quality education and promote lifelong learning opportunities for all&q;,&q;place&q;:3,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;ff70e48a-5128-4dbf-82b5-afc492a0a709&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;10. Reduce inequality within and among countries&q;,&q;place&q;:4,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;c32509b5-25ff-4a7a-b98a-4ea2e1387535&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;12. Ensure sustainable consumption and production patterns&q;,&q;place&q;:5,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;b2cbe072-2c73-47c6-a819-98d7838b912e&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;17. Strengthen the means of implementation and revitalize the global partnership for sustainable development&q;,&q;place&q;:6,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;ba9eeb22-d114-4e1a-814b-7befc2a08db1&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;14. Conserve and sustainably use the oceans, seas and marine resources for sustainable development&q;,&q;place&q;:7,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.specialapprover.identifier&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;80d3001c-8d48-4b39-8b8c-33b6b9853815&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;17&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.subject.agrovoc&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;a173968e-d9fb-4ee4-a844-2984aa4fd2cb&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en&q;,&q